### === AUTH (JWT) ===

### Login as admin (получить токен)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### Login as user (получить токен)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "password"
}

### Проверка без токена (должен вернуть 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### === BOOKS (с JWT токеном) ===
### Подставьте полученный токен вместо <TOKEN>

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgzMzI2MzI2LCJleHAiOjE3ODMzMjk5MjZ9.ckaKZasEM6ERaUsfnxN8Rmk9kAlM2BJi44B1TJ0wqZnX4GswBCSnnvRewofXwk5WCJyofnGYwHIt8qQsIDzHnA

### Get book by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/8

### Create book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Book",
  "authorId": 1,
  "genreId": 1
}

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "authorId": 1,
  "genreId": 2
}

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

