### === COMMENTS ===

### Get comments for book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/comments

### Get comment by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1

### Create comment for book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Great book!"
}

### Update comment
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Updated comment"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1
